{"sourceSha256": "213016259170c0841abe7b00b619092e6ae1ced9f139f9548898ca831cfaf96f", "text": "© %\n\n0\n\n@ET Anew Listening and Reading test is\n\na written for each test each month with a\ndifferent topic. This means each month\nthe challenge of the test is slightly more\nor slightly less than any other month.\nThis is reflected in the grade boundaries\nwhich are set for each test. This means\nthere isn't a pass score we can tell you to\naim for because the pass score for one\ntest will be different for another.\n\nThe advice we give to candidates is to\naim for two thirds of the questions in the\ntest you are taking to be correct. On test\nday, you may need a few more or a few\nless to achieve a B based on the\nchallenge of the paper that month but it\ngives you something to aim for. During\npractice, we recommend aiming for a\nscore in the low 30s to be confident of a\nB on test day.\n\nIf you are consistently achieving 30-32\nin practice, you can feel confident of\nachieving a B whatever the pass score. It\nis better to aim higher than aim for the\nabsolute minimum.\n\nYesterday at 09:56 -", "pages": [{"number": 1, "text": "© %\n\n0\n\n@ET Anew Listening and Reading test is\n\na written for each test each month with a\ndifferent topic. This means each month\nthe challenge of the test is slightly more\nor slightly less than any other month.\nThis is reflected in the grade boundaries\nwhich are set for each test. This means\nthere isn't a pass score we can tell you to\naim for because the pass score for one\ntest will be different for another.\n\nThe advice we give to candidates is to\naim for two thirds of the questions in the\ntest you are taking to be correct. On test\nday, you may need a few more or a few\nless to achieve a B based on the\nchallenge of the paper that month but it\ngives you something to aim for. During\npractice, we recommend aiming for a\nscore in the low 30s to be confident of a\nB on test day.\n\nIf you are consistently achieving 30-32\nin